:: Arrives {"position":"925,775","size":"100,100"}
''Mia:'' Hey you, you ready? Let's go.

You walk with Mia, then you ask "what dorm do you live in?"

''Mia:'' In Redwood.

You pause, then ask "isn't Redwood that way though?", while pointing behind you.

<img src="redwood.jpeg" width="350">

''Mia:'' Oh yeah, right.

You both turn and walk the other way. She seems to drop something.

[[Pause, and pick it up for her?->Pick Up]]
[[Keep walking, she'll catch up.->End 2]]


:: End {"position":"350,675","size":"100,100"}
<img src="tower-close.jpeg" width="350">

''* DING, DING, DING *'', The clock tower bells go off. Echoing throughout campus.

You see a flash ''bang'' in front of you, then the face of the girl.

<img src="https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/thumbnails/059/017/440/small/comic-style-explosion-shapes-black-line-art-white-background-dotted-shading-effect-starburst-designs-dynamic-outlines-varied-shapes-hand-drawn-look-digital-illustration-comic-book-element-free-png.png" width="200">

''MYSTERY GIRL:'' Don't ignore me.

You fall, and your world fades to black.

[[Try Again?->Exiting Library]]


:: End 2 {"position":"1050,900","size":"100,100"}
You continue walking while Mia picks up what she dropped.

''Mia:'' HEY!

''* DING, DING, DING *'', The clock tower bells go off. Echoing throughout campus.

<img src="tower-close.jpeg" width="350">

You turn to look at Mia, then a flash ''bang'' in front of you.

<img src="https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/thumbnails/059/017/440/small/comic-style-explosion-shapes-black-line-art-white-background-dotted-shading-effect-starburst-designs-dynamic-outlines-varied-shapes-hand-drawn-look-digital-illustration-comic-book-element-free-png.png" width="200">

''Mia:'' LEAVING ME ISN'T NICE!

You hear her before you lose balance, fall, and your world fades to black.

[[Try Again?->Exiting Library]]


:: End 3 {"position":"925,1025","size":"100,100"}
As she pauses, you continue walking.

''Mia:'' HEY!

''* DING, DING, DING *'', The clock tower bells go off. Echoing throughout campus.

<img src="tower-close.jpeg" width="350">

You turn to look at Mia, then a flash ''bang'' in front of you.

<img src="https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/thumbnails/059/017/440/small/comic-style-explosion-shapes-black-line-art-white-background-dotted-shading-effect-starburst-designs-dynamic-outlines-varied-shapes-hand-drawn-look-digital-illustration-comic-book-element-free-png.png" width="200">

''Mia:'' DON'T QUESTION ME AGAIN!

You hear her before you lose balance, fall, and your world fades to black.

[[Try Again?->Exiting Library]]


:: Exiting Library {"position":"800,525","size":"100,100"}
<h1>Study Buddies </h1>

<img src="outside-lib.jpeg" width="350">

It's 2:00AM, you stayed on-campus later than you meant to. You have a final exam at 8:30AM. You just pulled a 6-hour study session in the library and the only reason you're leaving is because they're closing. You walk out the door from the Central Ave building and see vast emptiness.

Dim, but not dark.

You hear trees brushing and swishing around in the wind.

<img src="tree-alley.jpeg" width="350">

Your phone buzzes.

''UNKNOWN NUMBER:'' Let's finish studying in my dorm?

As you read the text, you yawn, then you wonder who it could be?

You realize you gave a few students in various classes your phone number to study together, but you're not sure who it is.

[[Ignore the message and go home?->Go to Garage]]
[[Text back: Who is this?->Text Back]]


:: Go to Garage {"position":"675,650","size":"100,100"}
You decide you need some sleep, and want to go home.

You head towards the parking deck. In front of you, the NJIT Clock Tower in the night.

<img src="tower-far.jpeg" width="350">

As you walk towards the clock tower, a girl comes out from Fenster Hall, she looks at you, and starts walking towards you.

You wonder if she's going towards you, or heading in the direction you just came from?

[[Move towards the right, so there is distance between->Move Right]]
[[Continue walking straight->Straight]]


:: Good End {"position":"450,950","size":"100,100"}
You see a squirrel come out with bread in its mouth.

You pause.

Reflect on how you look at the moment, before standing straight again.

You say "I really need to go home."

You enter your car and drive home.

<img src="car.jpeg" width="350">

[[Try Again?->Exiting Library]]


:: Move Right {"position":"600,800","size":"100,100"}
You move right, you continue walking towards the clock tower, but alongside the Campus Center.

<img src="campus-center.jpeg" width="350">

The girl keeps her distance, glances at you, and walks in the direction you came from.

As you get closer to the tower, you hear something behind you.

[[Turn around and see what it is?->End]]
[[Start running to your car?->RUN]]


:: Pick Up {"position":"925,900","size":"100,100"}
You say, "I'll get it."

''Mia:'' Thanks.

You question her, "Why did we go that way first if you live in Redwood?"

''Mia:'' Oh, silly mistake.

You reply, "Yeah maybe, but still weird you don't know your way to your apartment."

[[Mia pauses->End 3]]


:: RUN {"position":"700,925","size":"100,100"}
You run to your car.

You still hear noises behind you.

You are panting, sweating, and exhausted, but you make it to your car. No more noise.

<img src="inside-deck.jpeg" width="350">

Right as you are going to unlock your car, you [[hear something to your right.->Trash Can]]


:: Straight {"position":"800,775","size":"100,100"}
You both get really close to each other.

She glances at you, you glance at her.

''MYSTERY GIRL:'' Hey.

You don't respond, and [[keep walking.->End]]


:: Text Back {"position":"925,650","size":"100,100"}
You text back.

''UNKNOWN NUMBER:'' It's Mia, from Math

You reply, "Hey Mia, yes, I'm down."

''UNKNOWN NUMBER:'' Okay, I see you came out from the library, wait for me there.

You assume she was probably in the library also and wait for her.

[[She arrives, from another dirrection.->Arrives]]


:: Trash Can {"position":"575,1050","size":"100,100"}
You jump and stance in a fight mode.

You hold your key blade between your fingers in a fist.

You scream "WHO IS IT?"

As you begin to pant, sweat, and get nervous, you look at the trash can 5 feet in front.

<img src="trash-can.jpeg" width="350">

It shakes, there is movement inside.

[["Come out!" You scream .->Good End]]
